📌 Product Requirements Document (PRD)

Project Name: NCS Santhanam Silk Website Redesign
Website: https://ncsanthanam.in/


📝 1. Objective

Redesign and enhance the existing NCS Santhanam Silk e-commerce website to improve:

Visual design and brand presence

User interaction and engagement

Navigation and product discovery

Conversion rates and sales

Mobile responsiveness

Trust and credibility

Current site sells traditional silk products including wedding sarees, fancy Kanjivarams, soft silk, gift options, etc.

🎯 2. Target Users
User Segment	Description
Primary Shopper	Women looking for premium sarees for weddings, festivals, and gifting
Gift Buyers	Users shopping for presents (e.g., gift sarees, pavadas)
Mobile Users	Users accessing via phones/tablets (majority expected traffic)
Repeat Customers	Users familiar with the brand and site
🧭 3. UX & UI Design Goals
✔️ Brand & Visual Identity

Elegant, premium Indian theme (reflect silk heritage)

Clear category hierarchy

Consistent use of brand colors and typography

✔️ Homepage

Must include:

Hero section with carousel banners (popular collections, new arrivals)

Promotional highlights (e.g., wedding saree collection)

Featured products & best-sellers

Testimonials or reviews

Newsletter signup & trust badges

📦 4. Functional Requirements
🛍️ Product Catalog & Shopping

Must include:

Multi-level categories: e.g., Wedding Sarees, Kanchipuram, Soft Silk, Gift Sarees, Pavadas, Dupattas, Men's Corner, Materials

Product filtering by price, type, fabric, color

Product quick view & detailed pages with zoom images

“Add to Cart” and optimized cart flow

📱 Mobile Responsiveness

Fully responsive UX

Touch-friendly interactions

Sticky cart button on product pages for easy conversion

🔍 Search & Navigation

Search bar with auto-suggest

Breadcrumb navigation

Clear category labels

Mega menu for quick access

🛒 Checkout

Guest checkout option

Multiple payment methods (UPI, cards, wallets)

Address auto-suggest

Estimated delivery cost & shipping times

📣 Engagement & Marketing

Homepage sliders for promotions

Newsletter subscription with incentive (e.g., discount)

Pop-up offers for first-time visitors

Social sharing on product pages

🧾 Trust & Support

Customer reviews on products

Trust badges (secure payments, return policy)

Contact page linking to:

Address: 59, Viladadikoil Street, Kancheepuram, Tamil Nadu – 631501

Email & phone

Return and shipping policy pages

